# `Template/` is the source of truth

When creating, changing, or fixing anything on the website (especially under `public/`), **use the matching patterns in `Template/` first**—including **all** of the HTML templates listed below, not only `index.html`.

## Template HTML files (complete inventory)

Reference these paths under `Template/` for structure, classes, section markup, and JS hooks:

- `404.html`
- `about-us.html`
- `appointment.html`
- `blog.html`
- `coming-soon.html`
- `contact.html`
- `element-appointment.html`
- `element-counter.html`
- `element-cta.html`
- `element-highlights.html`
- `element-info-box.html`
- `element-logos.html`
- `element-pricing-table.html`
- `element-service.html`
- `element-subscribe.html`
